---
import StudioNav from "@components/StudioNav.astro";
import SiteShell from "@components/SiteShell.astro";
import { maintenancePlans, studioPlans } from "@data/studio";
---

<SiteShell title="價格方案 | KJyang Studio" description="KJyang Studio website build and maintenance price ranges for small businesses." canonicalPath="/studio/pricing">
  <main class="studio-index">
    <StudioNav />
    <section class="studio-subpage-hero">
      <div class="wrap">
        <span>Pricing</span>
        <h1>先給價格區間，避免彼此浪費時間</h1>
        <p>實際報價會看頁面數、內容量、設計需求、部署方式和功能複雜度。網域費另計，客戶持有。</p>
      </div>
    </section>
    <section class="studio-card-section">
      <div class="wrap studio-pricing-grid">
        {studioPlans.map((plan) => (
          <article>
            <h2>{plan.title}</h2>
            <strong>{plan.price}</strong>
            <p>{plan.text}</p>
          </article>
        ))}
      </div>
      <div class="wrap studio-maintenance-grid">
        {maintenancePlans.map(([title, price, text]) => (
          <article>
            <b>{title}</b>
            <strong>{price}</strong>
            <p>{text}</p>
          </article>
        ))}
      </div>
    </section>
    <section class="studio-final-cta">
      <div class="wrap">
        <span>Budget fit</span>
        <h2>價格先公開，細節再依內容和功能確認。</h2>
        <p>想先知道你的需求大概落在哪個區間，可以傳目前網站或同行參考給我。</p>
        <div class="action-row">
          <a class="btn studio-index-primary" href="/studio/contact">預約諮詢報價</a>
          <a class="btn studio-index-secondary" href="/studio/process">看合作流程</a>
        </div>
      </div>
    </section>
  </main>
</SiteShell>
